  "description": "On a 21-minute clock: a 400 m run, then as many rounds as possible of 10 hand-release push-ups, 4 strict pull-ups, 20 kettlebell swings and 10 goblet squats with a 53/35 lb bell. Honours DEA Supervisory Special Agent Michael \"Mike\" Garbo, shot on an Amtrak train in Tucson in 2021. Steady pacing; the strict pull-ups are the limiter.",
